1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,628
Why does your dog tilt its head when you talk?

2
00:00:02,678 --> 00:00:05,848
One idea: its muzzle blocks part of your face.

3
00:00:05,898 --> 00:00:11,381
In one owner survey, long-muzzled dogs tilted more often than flat-faced ones.

4
00:00:11,431 --> 00:00:14,676
But a 2021 study found something stranger.

5
00:00:14,726 --> 00:00:20,398
Dogs that had learned their toys' names tilted their heads very often when they heard those names.

6
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:22,531
Most other dogs rarely did.

7
00:00:22,581 --> 00:00:25,410
And each dog tended to tilt to the same side.

8
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,688
So that little tilt may mean one thing.

9
00:00:27,738 --> 00:00:29,656
Your dog is listening hard.

10
00:00:29,706 --> 00:00:33,770
Say the name of their favorite ball, and watch.
